# Marketing review notes

**Source:** `marketing/launch-copy.md` vs `product/spec.md`  
**Review date:** 2026-09-11

## Claims unsupported by the product spec

| Copy claim | Spec says | Verdict |
|---|---|---|
| "Works offline, anywhere." | "Offline support: removed in this release." | Spec explicitly states offline support was removed. The copy claims it works offline. **Direct contradiction.** |
| "Export to CSV, PDF and Excel in one click." | "Export: CSV only." | Spec limits export to CSV. The copy promises PDF and Excel exports as well. **Not supported.** |

**Summary:** All three format claims (offline, PDF, Excel) are absent from or contradicted by the spec. The copy must be edited to remove claims of offline support and non-CSV export formats.

*Per standing order: findings cite the spec line behind them. No copy was edited.*
